{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And the breast of the waving.</b> This is the waving of the basket." "<b>And the thigh.</b> This is the thigh." "<b>The terumah.</b> This is the terumah of the thanksgiving offering." "<b>You shall eat in a pure place.</b> Rashi's interpretation: and were the first ones not etc. — meaning the leftover meal offering." "<b>My altar's offerings of well-being of the children of Israel.</b> To include those that were there that day, as it is written: ״ושור ואיל לשלמים״."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:11:11.865147789Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}